{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-7-1","title":"Acts 7:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Stephen, permitted to answer to the accusation of blasphemy, 2 shows that Abraham worshipped God rightly, and how God chose the fathers, 20 before Moses was born, and before the tabernacle and temple were built; 37 that Moses himself witnessed of Christ; 44 and that all outward ceremonies were ordained, according to the heavenly pattern, to last but for a time; 51 reprehending their rebellion, and murdering of Christ, the Just One, whom the prophets foretold should come into the world. 54 Whereupon they stone him to death, who commends his soul to Jesus, and humbly prays for them.</p>\n<p>Are. 6:13,14; Mt 26:61,62; Mr 14:58-60; Joh 18:19-21,33-35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-2","title":"Acts 7:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Men. 22:1; 23:7 The God. Ps 24:7,10; 29:3; Isa 6:3; Mt 6:13; Lu 2:14; Joh 1:14; 12:41 2Co 4:4-6; Tit 2:13; *Gr: Heb 1:3; Re 4:11; 5:12,13 appeared. Ge 12:1; Ne 9:7; Isa 51:2 when. Jos 24:2 Charran. Ge 11:31; 12:5; 29:4 Haran.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-3","title":"Acts 7:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Get. Ge 12:1; Mt 10:37; Lu 14:33; 2Co 6:17; Heb 11:8 the land. Ge 13:14-17; 15:7; Jos 24:3; Ne 9:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-4","title":"Acts 7:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>came. Ge 11:31,32; 12:4,5; Isa 41:2,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-5","title":"Acts 7:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>he gave. Ge 23:4; Ps 105:11,12; Heb 11:9,10,13-16 not. De 2:5 yet. Ge 12:7; 13:15; 15:3,18; 17:8; 26:3; 28:13-15; Ex 6:7,8; De 6:10,11 9:5; 10:11; 11:9; 34:4; Ne 9:8; Ps 105:8-11 when. Ge 15:2-5; 16:2; 17:16-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-6","title":"Acts 7:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>That. Ge 15:13,16 four. Ex 12:40,41; Ga 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-7","title":"Acts 7:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the nation. Ge 15:14-16; Ex 7:1-14:31; Ne 9:9-11; Ps 74:12-14; 78:43-51 Ps 105:27-36; 135:8,9; 136:10-15; Isa 51:9,10 and serve. Ex 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-8","title":"Acts 7:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the covenant. Ge 17:9-14; Joh 7:22; Ro 4:10; Ga 3:15,17 and so.Or, \"and thus,\" [kai houtos ,] in this covenant.</p>\n<p>Ge 17:12; 21:1-4 and Isaac. Ge 25:21-26; 1Ch 1:34; Mt 1:2; Ro 9:9-13 and Jacob. Ge 29:31-35; 30:1-24; 35:16,23-26; Ex 1:1-4; 1Ch 2:1,2 patriarchs. 2:29; Heb 7:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-9","title":"Acts 7:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>moved. Ge 37:4-11; 49:23; Mt 27:18 sold. Ge 37:18-29; 45:4; 50:15-20; Ps 105:17 but. Ge 39:2,5,21-23; 49:24; Isa 41:10; 43:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-10","title":"Acts 7:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>delivered. Ge 48:16; Ps 22:24; 34:17-19; 37:40; 40:1-3; 2Ti 4:18; Jas 5:11 Re 7:14 gave. Ge 41:12-46; 42:6; 44:18; 45:8,9; Ps 105:19-22; Pr 2:6; 3:4; 16:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-11","title":"Acts 7:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Ge 41:54-57; 43:1; 45:5,6,11; 47:13-15; Ps 105:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-12","title":"Acts 7:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Ge 42:1-24; 43:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-13","title":"Acts 7:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Joseph. Ge 45:1-18; 46:31-34; 47:1-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-14","title":"Acts 7:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>sent. Ge 45:9-11; Ps 105:23 threescore. Ge 46:12,26,27; De 10:22; 1Ch 2:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-15","title":"Acts 7:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Jacob. Ge 46:3-7; Nu 20:15; De 10:22; 26:5; Jos 24:4 died. Ge 49:33; Ex 1:6; Heb 11:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-16","title":"Acts 7:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>were.Of the two burying-places of the patriarchs, one was at Hebron, the cave and field which Abraham purchased of Ephron the Hittite, (Ge 23:16, etc.); the other in Sychem, which Jacob (not Abraham) bought of the sons of Emmor, (Ge 33:19.) To remove this glaring discrepancy, Markland interprets [para ,] from, as it frequently signifies with a genitive, and renders, \"And were carried over to Sychem; and afterwards from among the descendants of Emmor, the father, or son, of Sychem, they were laid in the sepulchre which Abraham bought for a sum of money.\" This agrees with the account which Josephus gives of the patriarchs; that they were carried out of Egypt, first to Sychem, and then to Hebron, where they were buried.</p>\n<p>Ex 13:19; Jos 24:32 the sepulchre. Ge 33:9-20; 35:19; 49:29-32 Emmor. Ge 34:2-31 Hamor, Shechem.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-17","title":"Acts 7:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>when. 6; Ge 15:13-16; 2Pe 3:8,9 the people. 13:17; Ex 1:7-12,20; Ps 105:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-18","title":"Acts 7:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Ex 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-19","title":"Acts 7:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Ex 1:9-22; Ps 83:4,5; 105:25; 129:1-3; Re 12:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-20","title":"Acts 7:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Moses. Ex 2:2-10 and was. 1Sa 16:12; Heb 11:23 exceeding fair. or, fair to God.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-21","title":"Acts 7:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>when. Ex 2:2-10; De 32:26 for. Heb 11:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-22","title":"Acts 7:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>was learned. 1Ki 4:29; 2Ch 9:22; Isa 19:11; Da 1:4,17-20 and was. Lu 24:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-23","title":"Acts 7:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>when. Ex 2:11,12; Heb 11:24-26 it came. Ex 35:21,29; 1Ch 29:17-19; 2Ch 30:12; Ezr 1:1,5; 7:27; Pr 21:1 2Co 8:16; Php 2:12,13; Jas 1:17; Re 17:17 to. 15:36; Ex 4:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-24","title":"Acts 7:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>28; Joh 18:10,11,25-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-25","title":"Acts 7:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>For. or, Now. God. 14:27; 15:4,7; 21:19; 1Sa 14:45; 19:5; 2Ki 5:1; Ro 15:18; 1Co 3:9 1Co 15:10; 2Co 6:1; Col 1:29 but. Ps 106:7; Mr 9:32; Lu 9:45; 18:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-26","title":"Acts 7:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>the next. Ex 2:13-15 ye are. Ge 13:8; 45:24; Ps 133:1; Pr 18:19; Joh 15:17,18; 1Co 6:6-8 Php 2:1,3; 1Jo 3:11-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-27","title":"Acts 7:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>he that. 54; 5:33; Ge 19:19; 1Sa 25:14,15; Pr 9:7,8 Who. 35,39; 3:13-15; 4:7,11,12; Mt 21:23; Lu 12:14; Joh 18:36,37 Joh 19:12-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-29","title":"Acts 7:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Ex 2:14-22; 4:19,20 Midian. Ex 18:2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-30","title":"Acts 7:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>when. 17; Ex 7:7 there. Ex 3:1; 19:1,2; 1Ki 19:8; Ga 4:25 Sinai. an. 32,35; Ge 16:7-13; 22:15-18; 32:24-30; 48:15,16; Ex 3:2,6; Isa 63:9 Ho 12:3-5; Mal 3:1 in a flame. De 4:20; Ps 66:12; Isa 43:2; Da 3:27 in a bush. 35; De 33:16; Mr 12:26; Lu 20:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-31","title":"Acts 7:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>and as. Ex 3:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-32","title":"Acts 7:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>I am. 3:13; Ge 50:24; Ex 3:6,15; 4:5; Mt 22:32; Heb 11:16 Then. 9:4-6; Ge 28:13-17; Ex 33:20; 1Ki 19:13; Job 4:14; 37:1,2; 42:5,6 Ps 89:7; Isa 6:1-5; Da 10:7,8; Mt 17:6; Lu 5:8; Re 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-33","title":"Acts 7:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Put. Ex 3:5; Jos 5:15; Ec 5:1; 2Pe 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-34","title":"Acts 7:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>I have seen. Ex 2:23-25; 3:7,9; 4:31; 6:5,6; Jud 2:18; 10:15,16; Ne 9:9; Ps 106:44 Isa 63:8,9 and am. Ge 11:5,7; 18:21; Ex 3:8; Nu 11:17; Ps 144:5; Isa 64:1; Joh 3:13 Joh 6:38 And now. Ex 3:10,14; Ps 105:26; Ho 12:13; Mic 6:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-35","title":"Acts 7:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>Moses. 9-15,27,28,51; 1Sa 8:7,8; 10:27; Lu 19:14; Joh 18:40; 19:15 the same. Ps 75:7; 113:7,8; 118:22,23 a ruler. 2:36; 3:22; 5:31; 1Sa 12:8; Ne 9:10-14; Ps 77:20; Isa 63:11,12 Re 15:3 by. 30; Ex 14:19,24; 23:20-23; 32:34; 33:2,12-15; Nu 20:16; Isa 63:9 Col 1:15; Heb 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-36","title":"Acts 7:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>brought. Ex 12:41; 33:1 after. Ex 7:1-14:31; De 4:33-37; 6:21,22; Ne 9:10; Ps 78:12,13,42-51 Ps 105:27-36; 106:8-11; 135:8-12; 136:9-15 in the Red. Ex 14:21,27-29 and in the wilderness. Ex 15:23-25; 16:1-17:16; 19:1-20:26; Nu 9:15-23; 11:1-35; 14:1-45 Nu 16:1-17:13; 20:1-21:35; De 2:25-37; 8:4; Ne 9:12-15,18-22 Ps 78:14-33; 105:39-45; 106:17,18; 135:10-12; 136:16-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-37","title":"Acts 7:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>that. 38; 2Ch 28:22; Da 6:13 A prophet. 3:22; De 18:15-19 like unto me. or, as myself. him. 3:23; Mt 17:3-5; Mr 9:7; Lu 9:30,31,35; Joh 8:46,47; 18:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-38","title":"Acts 7:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>in the church. Ex 19:3-17; 20:19,20; Nu 16:3-35,41,42 with the. 30,35,53; Isa 63:9; Ga 3:19; Heb 2:2 who. Ex 21:1-11; De 5:27-31; 6:1-3; 33:4; Ne 9:13,14; Joh 1:17 lively. De 30:19,20; 32:46,47; Ps 78:5-9; Joh 6:63; Ro 3:2; 9:4; 10:6-10 Heb 5:12; 1Pe 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-39","title":"Acts 7:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>whom. 51,52; Ne 9:16; Ps 106:16,32,33; Eze 20:6-14 but. 27; Jud 11:2; 1Ki 2:27 and in. Ex 14:11,12; 16:3; 17:3; Nu 11:5; 14:3,4; 21:5; Ne 9:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-40","title":"Acts 7:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>unto. Ex 32:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-41","title":"Acts 7:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>they. Ex 32:2-8,17-20; De 9:12-18; Ne 9:18; Ps 106:19-21 rejoiced. Isa 2:8,9; 44:9-20; Ho 9:1,10; Hab 2:18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-42","title":"Acts 7:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>and gave. Ps 81:11,12; Isa 66:4; Eze 14:7-10; 20:25,39; Ho 4:17; Ro 1:24-28 2Th 2:10-12 the host. De 4:19; 17:3; 2Ki 17:16; 21:3; Job 31:26-28; Jer 19:13; Eze 8:16 O ye. Am 5:25,26 have ye. Isa 43:23 of forty. Ps 95:10; Heb 3:9,15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-43","title":"Acts 7:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>ye took. Le 18:21; 20:2-5; 2Ki 17:16-18; 21:6 figures. Ex 20:4,5; De 4:16-18; 5:8,9 and I. 2Ki 17:6; 18:11; Am 5:27 Babylon.In the passage of Amos, to which Stephen refers, it is beyond Damascus; but as Assyria and Media, to which they were carried, were not only beyond Damascus, but beyond Babylon itself, he states that fact, and thus fixes more precisely the place of their captivity.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-44","title":"Acts 7:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>the tabernacle. Ex 38:21; Nu 1:50-53; 9:15; 10:11; 17:7,8; 18:2; Jos 18:1; 2Ch 24:6 speaking. or, who spake. that he. Ex 25:40; 26:30; 1Ch 28:11,19; Heb 8:2,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-45","title":"Acts 7:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>Which. Jos 3:11-14; 18:1; Jud 18:31; 1Sa 4:4; 1Ki 8:4; 1Ch 16:39; 21:29 that came after. or, having received. Jesus. Jos 3:6,7 Joshua. Heb 4:8 whom. 13:19; Ne 9:24; Ps 44:2; 78:55 unto. 2Sa 6:1-23; 1Ch 15:1-17:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-46","title":"Acts 7:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>found. 13:22; 1Sa 15:28; 16:1,11-13; 2Sa 6:21; 7:1,8,18,19; 1Ch 28:4,5 Ps 78:68-72; 89:19-37; 132:11 and desired. 2Sa 7:1-5; 1Ki 8:17-19; 1Ch 17:1-4; 22:7,8; 28:2,3; 29:2,3 Ps 132:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-47","title":"Acts 7:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>2Sa 7:13; 1Ki 5:1-18; 6:1,37,38; 7:13-51; 8:20; 1Ch 17:1 2Ch 2:1-4:22; Zec 6:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-48","title":"Acts 7:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>the most High. De 32:8; Ps 7:17; 46:4; 91:1,9; 92:8; Da 4:17,24,25,34; Ho 7:16 dwelleth. 17:24,25; 1Ki 8:27; 2Ch 2:5,6; 6:18 as. Isa 66:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-49","title":"Acts 7:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>Heaven. 1Ki 22:19; Ps 11:4; Jer 23:24; Mt 5:34,35; 23:22; Re 3:21 what house. Jer 7:4-11; Mal 1:11; Mt 24:2; Joh 4:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-50","title":"Acts 7:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>14:15; Ex 20:11; Ps 33:6-9; 50:9-12; 146:5,6; Isa 40:28; 44:24 Isa 45:7,8,12; Jer 10:11; 32:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-51","title":"Acts 7:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>stiffnecked. Ex 32:9; 33:3,5; 34:9; De 9:6,13; 31:27; 2Ch 30:8; Ne 9:16; Ps 75:5 Ps 78:8; Isa 48:4; Jer 17:23; Eze 2:4; Zec 7:11,12 uncircumcised. Le 26:41; De 10:16; 30:6; Jer 4:4; 6:10; 9:25,26; Eze 44:7,9 Ro 2:25,28,29; Php 3:3; Col 2:11 resist. 6:10; Ne 9:30; Isa 63:10; Eph 4:30 as. 9,27,35,39; Mt 23:31-33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-52","title":"Acts 7:52","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":52,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":52},"content":"<p>Which of. 1Sa 8:7,8; 1Ki 19:10,14; 2Ch 24:19-22; 36:16; Ne 9:26; Jer 2:30 Jer 20:2; 26:15,23; Mt 5:12; 21:35-41; 23:31-37; Lu 11:47-51 Lu 13:33,34; 1Th 2:15 which shewed. 3:18,24; 1Pe 1:11; Re 19:10 the Just One. 3:14; 22:14; Zec 9:9; 1Jo 2:1; Re 3:7 of whom. 2:23; 3:15; 4:10; 5:28-30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-53","title":"Acts 7:53","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":53,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":53},"content":"<p>have received. Ex 19:1-20:26; De 33:2; Ps 68:17; Ga 3:19; Heb 2:2 and have. Eze 20:18-21; Joh 7:19; Ro 2:23-25; Ga 6:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-7-54","title":"Acts 7:54","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterSta